{"agent":"g3-kilo","data":{"by":"g3-kilo","event":"e18f04da1541cc663fe380bd7","holder":"g3-kilo","note":"Stale main-red snapshot Bc23ce3dd38 (filed 2026-11-07 on DRV-plugin-sdk, test-only globs). Verified on main 0422a9b8c: test_adapters_clock_env ratchet is drifted by 14 SOURCE files under ddflow/services/{ci,perf,leases,swarm,review,lanes} (clock_env.json grew, e.g. ci/runner.py 3->5, perf/flakyrate.py 0->3, suits[lock] 8->9). Fix = migrate those to Clock/Env ports (P-adapters/P-perf-metrics/P-lock-lifecycle/P-swarm) + re-pin surface/mcp/golden baselines -- all OUTSIDE the fix task's test-only globs. Not inline-fixable in a bug lane; P-green-main owns closing once main green."},"id":"e291ffe8bd712f32708a225d1","kind":"lease.released","lamport":172513,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-Bc23ce3dd38","ts":"2026-11-11T09:38:13.083804Z"}
{"agent":"g3-kilo","data":{"fix_task":"fix-B506aa72f8e","item":"","repro":{"bytes":4692,"mode":"full","ref":"sha256:00253c0da8733447293eed682f1b63f357abd8f7ddb533c86186cf0fb4ba8309","truncated":false},"scope":"ddflow","severity":"medium","summary":"Every event-log append (claim/merge/complete) emits one stderr warning per [[reviewer]]: 'sets family, gates, hedge, max_chunk_chars, ... which this ddflow does not know; skipped. The config is newer than this code: merge main into this tree'. It is FALSE: ddflow.services.review.model.Reviewer knows every one of those fields. The warning comes from ddflow/infra/log/_eventlog.py::_reviewer_redact_names, which reads reviewers.toml against the deliberately-narrow _LocalReviewer (name/model/base_url only, to keep the log layer from importing services.review) with lenient=True, so tomlcfg._check treats family/gates/etc as unknown and prints the misleading 'newer than this code' remedy. The narrowing is intentional, not a newer config. The false alarm misled sibling lanes f3-kilo and bug3-kilo into declaring a repo-wide 'all reviewers skipped, rubber_duck/critic cannot run, every complete is a person-gate' blocker when ddflow reviewers list + load_reviewers show grok-4.7 (xai) and gemini-3.5-flash-lite (google) still serving critic+rubber_duck. Fix: _reviewer_redact_names should read the file without the 'does not know/newer than code' warning (its _LocalReviewer view is intentional), or pass a quiet-skip signal to _check.","tags":["review","dx","scope:ddflow"],"title":"event-log appends warn 'reviewers.toml fields unknown/config newer than code' that this ddflow DOES know, a false all-reviewers-broken alarm"},"id":"e5c297e69de81e362229252a0","kind":"bug.found","lamport":172524,"schema":1,"subject":"B506aa72f8e","ts":"2026-11-11T09:39:34.157120Z"}
{"agent":"g3-kilo","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B506aa72f8e: Every event-log append (claim/merge/complete) emits one stderr warning per [[reviewer]]: 'sets family, gates, hedge, max_chunk_chars, ... which this ddflow does not know; skipped. The config is newer than this code: merge main into this tree'. It is FALSE: ddflow.services.review.model.Reviewer knows every one of those fields. The warning comes from ddflow/infra/log/_eventlog.py::_reviewer_redact_names, which reads reviewers.toml against the deliberately-narrow _LocalReviewer (name/model/base_url only, to keep the log layer from importing services.review) with lenient=True, so tomlcfg._check treats family/gates/etc as unknown and prints the misleading 'newer than this code' remedy. The narrowing is intentional, not a newer config. The false alarm misled sibling lanes f3-kilo and bug3-kilo into declaring a repo-wide 'all reviewers skipped, rubber_duck/critic cannot run, every complete is a person-gate' blocker when ddflow reviewers list + load_reviewers show grok-4.7 (xai) and gemini-3.5-flash-lite (google) still serving critic+rubber_duck. Fix: _reviewer_redact_names should read the file without the 'does not know/newer than code' warning (its _LocalReviewer view is intentional), or pass a quiet-skip signal to _check.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B506aa72f8e --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B506aa72f8e --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["B506aa72f8e"],"globs":[],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"bugs","priority":10,"tags":["bugfix","no-deps"],"title":"Fix bug B506aa72f8e: event-log appends warn 'reviewers.toml fields unknown/config newer than code' that this ddflow D..."},"id":"e799446519eaa0adca6fb6281","kind":"task.added","lamport":172525,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B506aa72f8e","ts":"2026-11-11T09:39:34.364102Z"}
